 away from traditional road and track games.\nA NEW RACING ENVIRONMENT\nTrade asphalt for open water and experience racing from a first-person VR perspective. The water-based setting gives this racing game its own identity and puts you right in the driver's seat.\nBUILD YOUR RACING SKILLS\nLearn the demands of boat driving and work toward better performances as you become familiar with the experience. Each session gives you an opportunity to refine your approach and challenge yourself.\nMADE FOR WATER-RACING FANS\nLooking for something beyond car racing? Explore speedboat action in a VR experience focused on racing across water.\nYOUR NEXT RACE STARTS HERE\nGet ready to discover boat racing from a new perspective on Meta Quest.\n", "short_description": "Get ready for boat racing on Meta Quest! Pilot a speedboat, master your steering, and experience high-speed water racing in an immersive boat racing game. Take on the water and put your racing skills to the test."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wasigamestudio/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wasi Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wasi-game-studio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "1392864313911